  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e05-scene-17",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "六年学习制作  (Six Years Studying Production)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Refusing to give up on her proposal, Bu Xiaogu runs outside after Chun Yuqiao at night and pours out her six-year dream of becoming a television producer. Listen to their heartfelt Mandarin conversation first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总，虽然我只是个行政助理，但我花了六年的时间学习制作。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我最大的梦想就是当制作人，让我付出多大的代价都行。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "粉丝众筹成立慈善基金会是个特别好的选题，所以我才拼命地争取。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这是在您的指导下完成的，这一定是最好的提案。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "求求您了，给我一个机会！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "上次我说你作风不正，是我错怪你了，你一句都没有辩解。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "今天为了这个策划案的事，你跟我说了这么多。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "成为一个制作人是你最在意的事，是吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "六年寒窗，甚至更长的时间，你就只有一个目标。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我给你个机会，明天的提案会，你跟别人正常竞争。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "谢谢淳于总，什么都难不倒布小谷！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "淳于总，虽然我只是个行政助理，但我花了六年的时间学习制作。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mr Chun Yuqiao, though I am only an administrative assistant, I spent six years studying production.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我最大的梦想就是当制作人，让我付出多大的代价都行。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'My biggest dream is to become a producer, no matter what price I have to pay.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "粉丝众筹成立慈善基金会是个特别好的选题，所以我才拼命地争取。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Fans crowdfunding a charity foundation is a wonderful topic, which is why I fought hard for it.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这是在您的指导下完成的，这一定是最好的提案。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It was completed under your guidance, so it is bound to be the best proposal.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "求求您了，给我一个机会！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I beg you, please give me one chance!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "上次我说你作风不正，是我错怪你了，你一句都没有辩解。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Last time I accused you of improper conduct; I wronged you, yet you never said a word in defence.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "今天为了这个策划案的事，你跟我说了这么多。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Today, for the sake of this programme proposal, you have said all this to me.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "成为一个制作人是你最在意的事，是吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Becoming a producer is what you care about most, is it not?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "六年寒窗，甚至更长的时间，你就只有一个目标。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Through six years of study, and even longer, you have held onto just one goal.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我给你个机会，明天的提案会，你跟别人正常竞争。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I will give you a chance; at tomorrow's pitch meeting, compete fairly with everyone else.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "谢谢淳于总，什么都难不倒布小谷！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thank you, Mr Chun Yuqiao — nothing can stump Bu Xiaogu!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
